## 9. Debugging unexpected copies

### Plain English

Assertions document invariants. `assert` is for runtime checks in debug builds; `static_assert` fails at compile time. Sanitizers catch many memory and UB bugs early.

### Tiny code

```cpp
#include <cassert>
